# Media project

Agent skill: [.cursor/skills/media-agent/SKILL.md](../skills/media-agent/SKILL.md)

## Scope

`media/frontend`, `media/backend`, `media/backend/migrations`, `packages/media-embed`.

Consumer embed contract: `@webonone/media-embed` (`packages/media-embed/`).

## Ports and env

| Layer | Port | Env file |
|-------|------|----------|
| Frontend | 3003 | `media/frontend/.env` |
| Backend | 4003 | `media/backend/.env` |

`JWT_SECRET` must match Identity backend.

## Ownership

- All blob storage and media metadata in `webonone_media`.
- Embed routes `/picker`, `/upload` with `parentOrigin` + `scope` query params.
- JWT verification locally; no per-request Identity HTTP.

## Verification

```bash
npm run type-check -w media-root
npm run migrate -w media-root
cd media && npm run dev
```

Do not duplicate upload UI in consumers — embed Media routes via `@webonone/media-embed`.
